# The one CerebroNexus revision every topic measures, installs or captures. Change it here, and only here, when the
# final branch moves; the lock files of the topics that keep their own copy (expression_backends, interface_figures)
# and the defaults of the run scripts are checked against it by tests/test-pin.R.
# ref     the branch the commit was taken from (a name for people; the commit is what is used)
# commit  the full hash: a run measures `git archive` of exactly this
# version  the DESCRIPTION version at that commit
# repo    where the commit can be fetched from. NOTE: a commit that is only in a local clone cannot be fetched by
#         the topics that clone from this URL (expression_backends, interface_figures); push the branch first.
ref=integration/8.3.0
commit=e927cbf180fb1a50cf783245ab580e83a1334764
version=8.3.0
repo=https://github.com/duocang/CerebroNexus.git
